<title>USA: TABLE - Patriot Q2 FFO shr $0.46 vs $0.41.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Patriot Q2 FFO shr $0.46 vs $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> FFO/shr	   $0.46		    $0.41</p>
<p> Shr		 0.26		     0.29</p>
<p> FFO		 24,509		   14,949</p>
<p> Net		 11,818		   8,683</p>
<p> Revs		40,560		   19,248</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  44,985		   30,349</p>
<p>Six months</p>
<p> FFO/shr	   $0.89		    $0.75</p>
<p> Shr		 0.52		     0.53</p>
<p> FFO		 47,432		   26,583</p>
<p> Net		 23,166		   15,811</p>
<p> Revs		76,969		   33,074</p>
<p> Avg		 44,783		   29,906</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The outstanding share figures reflect the two-for-one split  on March 18 1997, the merger with California Jockey Club/Bay Meadows,  and the 1.927-for-one split on July 25 1997.</p>
<p>Shares in Patriot American Hospitality Inc and its operating company  Patriot American Hospitality Operating Co trade as a single unit on  the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol &quot;PAH.&quot;</p>
